	(text "TREE-01 board B (tree-b): LED board, 4 layers, outer face (F.Cu) = LEDs D1-D8, inner face\n(B.Cu) = J4. No power circuit: the 8 lines LED_L1..LED_L8 come from board A through J4\n(mates J3 on A, D3/D14); board A drives them (GPIO -> 22R -> J3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 10.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1190b821-dd67-54d7-989c-f4c6f89ad817")
	)
	(text "Pads: 3 anode, 1 R, 2 G, 4 B cathode. Board B: R on a+2, G on a+3, B on a+7\n(tree_common.LED_MATRIX).\nLED -> (R, G, B cathode line):\nD1 (anode L1) -> R L3, G L4, B L8\nD2 (anode L2) -> R L4, G L5, B L1\nD3 (anode L3) -> R L5, G L6, B L2\nD4 (anode L4) -> R L6, G L7, B L3\nD5 (anode L5) -> R L7, G L8, B L4\nD6 (anode L6) -> R L8, G L1, B L5\nD7 (anode L7) -> R L1, G L2, B L6\nD8 (anode L8) -> R L2, G L3, B L7"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "11b38e48-b53f-5ae8-8fd6-a51b3669890e")
	)
	(text "The outline and the Ø1.4 hanging hole are board-only (layout generator). Same LED part as\nboard A (one unique Extended part per order)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "16b48c6d-9de3-5539-b75c-12ec6a73c954")
	)
	(text "RGB LEDs D1-D8 (XL-1010RGB-YG, common anode)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 31.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3bce191b-46e1-568e-a68f-ac7f4980ee3a")
	)
	(text "J4 to board A (D3, D14)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 168.91 31.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "946e198d-e0c8-56f6-97bb-3bdeabbb536f")
	)
	(text "MH3 / MH4: plated Ø2.2 mm holes at the M2 positions of both boards\n(tree_outline.MOUNT_HOLES), 4.4 mm ring on both faces. Brass standoffs (12.0 mm) between\nthe boards carry GND to the matching rings on board A's inner face; nylon screws. Not\nassembled, not in the BOM or the position file. PWR_FLAG = ERC marker."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a63f6e92-2ce4-53a5-bbe9-5fd648cabacd")
	)
	(text "View from the top of board A (the F.Cu view of both boards):\nJ4 is on B.Cu, so its pin 1 is top right and touches J3 pin 2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.3 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a6dae114-f4ea-59e8-9506-a8ab178f7c61")
	)
	(text "Ground to board A (D31): M2 mount holes with a GND ring"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 168.91 122.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ad66f208-9fff-53f1-a1fe-f00df0f6123b")
	)
	(text "pin 1"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 205.23 42.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b189ebf0-d088-5652-b273-5d28986d15cd")
	)
	(text "J4 male 2x4 SMD (Boom PZ254, C192300), inner face = B.Cu.\nPin=line: 1=L8, 2=L1, 3=L7, 4=L2\n5=L6, 6=L3, 7=L5, 8=L4\nMirrored by B.Cu: J4 pin n mates J3 pin n+1 (n odd) / n-1\n(n even): J3.1-J4.2, J3.2-J4.1, J3.3-J4.4, J3.4-J4.3, ...\nNet of each pin = net of the J3 pad it touches\n(tree_common.j4_pin_net / mate_table).\nNo supply, no ground on J4: the 8 lines (GND is on MH3/MH4 only).\nJ4 plastic height 3.2 mm: UNVERIFIED (PARTS-REVIEW B1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bb6d8f18-d721-5141-9ea6-d07c3e40bb78")
	)
